      "text": "Phase 13.7-13.9 已实现：0014 evidence outbox、usage settlement 与 event capacity reservation；0015 DelegationService 和 durable aggregation；0016 shared parent execution-tree budget；HTTP SSE / CLI NDJSON 共用 canonical bytes reader、可见 cursor、受限分页、慢客户端无预取与 terminal EOF。outbox 只补投 evidence、不重放 provider/tool；WS 仍属 P1。",
